ment Q&amp;A\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 768px, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FCreating-a-website-i1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FCreating-a-website-i1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FCreating-a-website-i1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FCreating-a-website-i1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FCreating-a-website-i1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FCreating-a-website-i1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FCreating-a-website-i1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FCreating-a-website-i1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FCreating-a-website-i1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"prose-blog mt-8\" dir=\"ltr\"><h3>Part 2</h3>\n<h2>Q&amp;A About Investing in a Startup</h2>\n<h5>◾️Question<br />\nWho do you negotiate with?<br />\nHow are the negotiations conducted?</h5>\n<h4>🔹#Answer<br />\nWith those who demonstrate to us that they have the ability to invest.<br />\nTo respect both parties' time, initial discussions are held remotely.<br />\nAnd after things become serious, they will be in person.<br />\nIn-person negotiations will take place in #Tehran.<br />\nThe investor should preferably be familiar with or professional in the software market.<br />\nAdditionally, the person we negotiate with must be a professional businessperson who fully understands business. We negotiate with a professional individual, even if they have not invested in software before. What's important is that they understand business principles professionally and have experience in it. We want to deal with someone at a high level of business knowledge, and the investor should enter the process with at least professional advisors.</h4>\n<h5>◾️#Question<br />\nCan a broker also raise capital for you, and what is the commission structure?</h5>\n<h5>🔹Answer<br />\nYes, they can, and it's natural that they should receive a commission. The amount received is agreed upon according to the contract or meeting minutes.</h5></div><aside aria-label=\"Ready to turn this into a product?\" class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-violet-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-600/10 to-fuchsia-600/10 p-5 sm:p-6\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-violet-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z\"></path><path d=\"m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0\"></path><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path></svg>Ready to turn this into a product?</h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">In one AI MVP Sprint I take your idea from first sketch to a live product — in weeks, not months.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-fuchsia-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:from-violet-700 hover:to-fuchsia-700\" href=\"/mvp-sprint\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0